    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Why This Investment Makes Sense Section -->
  <div class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Why This Investment Transforms Palermo</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Digital nomads aren't just tourists—they're potential residents, entrepreneurs, and community builders who invest deeply in the places they love.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
